# SISMO911 Worker secret manifest — single source of truth for bootstrap-secrets.sh
# and preflight.sh. Format: NAME|LEVEL|DESCRIPTION
#   LEVEL = required     → deploy MUST abort if missing
#           recommended  → preflight warns if missing (feature degraded/insecure)
#           optional     → only needed for a specific integration
# Runtime secrets live ONLY in Cloudflare Worker Secrets (wrangler secret put) —
# never in wrangler.toml [vars], .env, or git. Public values (VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY,
# RAV_SUPABASE_KEY anon JWT) intentionally stay in [vars] and are NOT listed here.
PLAN_SECRET|required|HMAC signing secret for the /plan access cookie
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY|recommended|Web Push private key (push notifications)
RAV_INGEST_TOKEN|recommended|Bearer gate for POST /api/rav/run
BLOG_INGEST_TOKEN|recommended|Bearer gate for /api/blog/* + events backfill
ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN|recommended|one-time first-admin bootstrap
PLAN_INVITE_CODES|optional|comma-separated /plan invite codes (has safe fallback)
YOUTUBE_API_KEY|optional|blog video source (YouTube Data API)
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY|optional|/operaciones Google Maps
MONITOR_WEBHOOK_SECRET|optional|power-monitor webhook HMAC
CROSSMINT_SERVER_KEY|optional|donations — Crossmint server key
CROSSMINT_CLIENT_KEY|optional|donations — Crossmint client key
CROSSMINT_WEBHOOK_SECRET|optional|donations — Crossmint/Svix webhook HMAC
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY|optional|Cloudflare Turnstile verification
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID|optional|telemedicina WhatsApp/SMS confirmations
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN|optional|telemedicina WhatsApp/SMS confirmations
TWILIO_SMS_FROM|optional|telemedicina SMS sender (E.164)
TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM|optional|telemedicina WhatsApp sender
GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN|optional|Google OAuth refresh token (sheets sync)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET|optional|Google OAuth client secret
APIFY_TOKEN|optional|legacy social scrape (Worker-side fetch now preferred)
X402_FACILITATOR_URL|optional|x402 payments — facilitator base URL (verify+settle); with X402_PAYMENTS_ENABLED=true turns receiving LIVE
X402_FACILITATOR_API_KEY|optional|x402 payments — facilitator bearer token (e.g. CDP mainnet)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY|optional|Stripe Checkout/Connect — secret API key (sk_live/sk_test); with STRIPE_PAYMENTS_ENABLED=true turns the card rail LIVE
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET|optional|Stripe — endpoint signing secret (whsec_) for /api/stripe/webhook signature verification
OAUTH_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET|optional|social login — Google OAuth client SECRET (pair with public OAUTH_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in [vars]); social buttons appear only when both set
